        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Riven: The Sequel to Myst is a graphic adventure puzzle game developed by Cyan and released in 1997. It continues the story of Myst, following the player’s journey to rescue Atrus’s wife, Catherine, from a decaying world. The game features pre-rendered environments with complex, interconnected puzzles and minimal direct guidance.\nIts visuals, sound design, and world-building were praised for their depth and realism.\nRiven expanded on Myst’s narrative and gameplay scale, becoming one of the most acclaimed adventure games of its time.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
